<%- if owner -%>
👑 You're the owner, so you get premium for free.
<%- elsif payment -%>
⭐ <b>Premium until <%= paid_until %></b>
<%= payment.is_recurring ? (payment.renewal_canceled? ? 'Renewal cancelled: it ends then.' : "Renews automatically for #{price} Stars.") : '' %>

Manage it in <b>⚙️ Settings</b>, or in Telegram under Settings → My Stars.
<%- else -%>
You don't have premium right now.
<%- end -%>
